{% comment %}
  6JOHAN Product FAQ — 「選び方＋よくある質問」＋ FAQPage 構造化データ
  2026-11-23 / AIO対策①（アクセス上位20商品へ横展開）

  目的:
    AI検索（AI Overviews・ChatGPT・Perplexity等）がそのまま引用できるよう、
    商品ページに「結論→スペック→1問1答」を1ブロックで用意する。

  データ:
    snippets/6johan-product-faq-data.liquid（素のJSON）にハンドル別で定義。
    21商品ぶんのサイズ・素材・納期・用途は各商品ページの実データのみ。
    該当ハンドル以外では何も出力しない（空枠を作らない）。

  使い方:
    templates/product.json の order に "6johan_product_faq" を追加（設定済み）。
    商品の追加・修正は data ファイルだけを編集すればよい。
{% endcomment %}

{%- capture j6faq_json -%}{% render '6johan-product-faq-data' %}{%- endcapture -%}
<!--J6DBG raw={{ j6faq_json.size }} strip={{ j6faq_json | strip | size }}-->
{%- assign j6faq_all = j6faq_json | strip | parse_json -%}
<!--J6DBG parsed={{ j6faq_all.size }} handle={{ product.handle }} item={{ j6faq_all[product.handle].size }} lead={{ j6faq_all[product.handle].lead | size }}-->
{%- assign faq = j6faq_all[product.handle] -%}

{%- if faq != nil and faq.lead != blank -%}
  <style>
    .j6faq {
      background: #fff;
      border-top: 1px solid #efebe4;
      padding: 5.6rem 0 6.4rem;
    }
    .j6faq__wrap {
      max-width: 96rem;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 2rem;
    }
    .j6faq__label {
      display: block;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #8a7a6e;
    }
    .j6faq__title {
      margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1.5;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      color: #292724;
    }
    .j6faq__conclusion {
      margin: 1.6rem 0 0;
      max-width: 66rem;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.95;
      color: #292724;
    }
    .j6faq__specs {
      margin: 2.4rem 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #efebe4;
    }
    .j6faq__spec {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.6rem;
      padding: 1.1rem 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #efebe4;
    }
    .j6faq__spec dt {
      flex: 0 0 9rem;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: #8a7a6e;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
    .j6faq__spec dd {
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      min-width: 0;
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
      color: #292724;
    }
    .j6faq__list {
      margin: 3.2rem 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #ded8cf;
    }
    .j6faq__item {
      border-bottom: 1px solid #ded8cf;
    }
    .j6faq__item > summary {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.2rem;
      padding: 1.7rem 0;
      cursor: pointer;
      list-style: none;
      font-size: 1.45rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #292724;
    }
    .j6faq__item > summary::-webkit-details-marker {
      display: none;
    }
    .j6faq__item > summary::marker {
      content: '';
    }
    .j6faq__q {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      padding-top: 0.15rem;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: #6b5b4f;
    }
    .j6faq__qtext {
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      min-width: 0;
    }
    .j6faq__mark {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      position: relative;
      width: 1.4rem;
      height: 1.4rem;
      margin-top: 0.55rem;
    }
    .j6faq__mark::before,
    .j6faq__mark::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 0;
      width: 1.4rem;
      height: 1px;
      background: #8a7a6e;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }
    .j6faq__mark::after {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
    .j6faq__item[open] .j6faq__mark::after {
      transform: rotate(0deg);
    }
    .j6faq__a {
      padding: 0 2.6rem 1.9rem 3.3rem;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      line-height: 1.95;
      color: #4a4640;
    }
    .j6faq__a p {
      margin: 0;
    }
    .j6faq__note {
      margin: 2.4rem 0 0;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: #8a7a6e;
    }
    @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
      .j6faq {
        padding: 4rem 0 4.6rem;
      }
      .j6faq__wrap {
        padding: 0 1.6rem;
      }
      .j6faq__title {
        font-size: 1.95rem;
      }
      .j6faq__conclusion {
        font-size: 1.42rem;
        line-height: 1.9;
      }
      .j6faq__spec dt {
        flex: 0 0 7.2rem;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
      }
      .j6faq__spec dd {
        font-size: 1.3rem;
      }
      .j6faq__item > summary {
        padding: 1.6rem 0;
        font-size: 1.38rem;
      }
      .j6faq__a {
        padding: 0 0 1.8rem 2.2rem;
        font-size: 1.32rem;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <section class="j6faq" id="faq" aria-labelledby="j6faq-title-{{ section.id }}">
    <div class="j6faq__wrap">
      <span class="j6faq__label">Q &amp; A</span>
      <h2 class="j6faq__title" id="j6faq-title-{{ section.id }}">選び方とよくある質問</h2>
      <p class="j6faq__conclusion">{{ faq.lead }}</p>

      <dl class="j6faq__specs">
        {%- for spec in faq.specs -%}
          {%- if spec[1] != blank -%}
            <div class="j6faq__spec"><dt>{{ spec[0] }}</dt><dd>{{ spec[1] }}</dd></div>
          {%- endif -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      </dl>

      <div class="j6faq__list">
        {%- for qa in faq.qa -%}
          <details class="j6faq__item">
            <summary>
              <span class="j6faq__q">Q</span>
              <span class="j6faq__qtext">{{ qa[0] }}</span>
              <span class="j6faq__mark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            </summary>
            <div class="j6faq__a"><p>{{ qa[1] }}</p></div>
          </details>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      <p class="j6faq__note">※ サイズ・素材は{{ 'now' | date: '%Y年%-m月' }}時点の仕様です。価格・在庫・最新の納期は商品ページ上部の表示をご確認ください。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "@id": {{ request.origin | append: product.url | append: '#faq' | json }},
      "url": {{ request.origin | append: product.url | json }},
      "name": {{ product.title | append: ' の選び方とよくある質問' | json }},
      "mainEntity": [
        {%- assign printed = 0 -%}
        {%- for qa in faq.qa -%}
          {%- if printed > 0 %},{% endif -%}
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": {{ qa[0] | json }},
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": {{ qa[1] | json }}
            }
          }
          {%- assign printed = printed | plus: 1 -%}
        {%- endfor -%}
      ]
    }
  </script>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "6JOHAN 選び方・Q&A",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "snippets/6johan-product-faq-data.liquid のハンドル別データに応じて、選び方の結論・スペック・Q&A・FAQPage構造化データを出力します。未登録の商品では何も表示しません。"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "6JOHAN 選び方・Q&A"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
